@baseUrl = https://localhost:7289
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_PLATFORM_ADMIN_BEARER_TOKEN
@serviceTypeId = REPLACE_WITH_SERVICE_TYPE_ID

### MF-01: Platform Admin reads the role mapping used by Job view/submit authorization.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/service-types/{{serviceTypeId}}/allowed-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Expected: 200 with service type metadata and role mappings (roleCode, canView, canSubmit).
### Use a non-existent UUID to verify the 404 path. Use a non-admin JWT to verify 403.

### MF-01: Platform Admin replaces all role mappings for a Service Type.
### Use role IDs returned by GET above. Omitted roles are removed intentionally.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/service-types/{{serviceTypeId}}/allowed-roles
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roles": [
    {
      "roleId": "REPLACE_WITH_AFFILIATE_RECRUITER_ROLE_ID",
      "canView": true,
      "canSubmit": true
    },
    {
      "roleId": "REPLACE_WITH_CANDIDATE_ROLE_ID",
      "canView": false,
      "canSubmit": false
    }
  ]
}

### Expected: 200. Then repeat GET to verify persistence.
### Expected errors: 400 for duplicate/unknown roleId, 403 for non-admin, 404 for unknown serviceTypeId.
